      "mergeID": "633b3cb8733c2f6b42178f4b",
      "mergedPostDetails": "With the new menu I have noticed a considerable increase in the time it takes before a newly uploaded avatar is added to the list of avatars. \nI'm not sure if this is purely the new menu or if this is coincidentally related to some API changes.\nIn any case, having a manual \"check for new uploads\" button would be very welcome",
      "mergedPostTitle": "new avatars on account not updating since Menu 2.0",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "631a4ce19b6ea744a6e76f83",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Same problem when you add someone to your friend list, it don't appear...\nand also friend reported me that bug (never tested need other people to test it):\n- \"Upgrade role\" (eg: User --> Known User) not show without reboot (he closed VRC for 2h then he obtained new status)\n- New World Created.\nseem like the new client don't sync everything",
