      "mergeID": "635058e6c1da8d451844d750",
      "mergedPostDetails": "The VRChat client does not seem to reload / discover changes done to test avatars when the game is open.\nYou have to close and open it again to reload local test avatars.\n[Scenario 1]\n1. Have the game open\n2. Build & Test avatar with new ID\n3. Go to game, and see the new avatar does not show up in the \"Others\" avatar tab until you restart the game.\n[Scenario 2]\n1. Have the game open.\n2. In Unity, go to Content Manager and remove test avatars you don't want to use anymore\n3. Go to VRChat, the avatars will still appear, but if you click them, they show error avatar.\nYou need to restart vrchat client for changes to take effect.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Avatar Build & Test discovery seems bugged",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "631a4ce19b6ea744a6e76f83",
      "private": false,
      "spam": false,
      "synthetic": true,
      "value": ""
    },
