      "mergeID": "63695422f0dfe37223aa6bf4",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Sometimes it works fine. The avatar updates by itself because I wrote the start parameter --watch-avatars. Often the avatar doesn't change itself, so I do it the old-fashioned way. I choose another avatar, then a local one. It often happens that vrchat crashes at random moments. I'm attaching a log after the crash. hope this helps\nhttps://pastebin.com/BaAbcmya",
